msgstr ""

#: tina_triangle/tony_tina_love_divert_just_tony/57
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "He may not be much of a contractor, but if there's one thing this man excels at... it's laying pipe."
msgstr ""

#: tina_triangle/tony_tina_love_divert_just_tony/68
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Tina is long gone by the time Tony leaves your house, but he gives you the sweetest kiss on his way out, assuring you he'll be back anytime you need your pipes cleaned or a bookshelf built."
msgstr ""

#: tina_triangle/tony_tina_love_divert_both/0
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Tina and Tony's heads snap towards you as one, and for once they both seem to be on the same page."
msgstr ""

#: tina_triangle/tony_tina_love_divert_both/11
msgctxt "Tina"
msgid "Not a love triangle... a threesome."
msgstr ""

#: tina_triangle/tony_tina_love_divert_both/22
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Tina looks at you, for the first time, with something approaching love in her eyes—this might be the most genuine emotion you've ever seen in her."
msgstr ""

#: tina_triangle/tony_tina_love_divert_both/33
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Tony on the other hand, simply looks happy to be here—he sweeps you into his arms, encouraging you to kiss Tina, then him... everything ramps up after that."
msgstr ""

#: tina_triangle/tony_tina_love_divert_both/44
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Tony takes you both away to your bedroom, where the three of you have the wildest night of your life thus far."
msgstr ""

#: tina_triangle/tony_tina_love_divert_both/58
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Tina is in her element here, insisting the two of you cater to her every whim—and while she might be demanding, you can't help but respect that she's a woman who knows what she wants and what she's about."
msgstr ""

#: tina_triangle/tony_tina_love_divert_both/69
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Tony has his pride, but he takes orders well, and by the time the three of you are finished all of you, even Tina, are equally spent and satisfied."
msgstr ""

#: tina_triangle/tony_tina_love_divert_both/80
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Tina is surprisingly gentle in the afterglow, quiet and thoughtful. She waits until morning to leave, but she does so without a word to either you or Tony."
msgstr ""

#: tina_triangle/tony_tina_love_divert_both/94
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Tony takes his time leaving, giving you the sweetest kiss on his way out. He assures you he'll be back anytime you need your pipes cleaned or a bookshelf built."
msgstr ""

#: tina_triangle/tony_tina_love_join/0
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Tony checks in with you frequently after leaving the house, but Tina never says a word. However, it doesn't take long for you to find out what she's been up to."
msgstr ""

#: tina_triangle/tony_tina_love_join/11
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Tina and Tony turn up on a reality show for couples looking to open up their relationships to a third, and their relationship is so unbelievably toxic the TV show is an instant hit."
msgstr ""

#: tina_triangle/tony_tina_love_join/22
msgctxt "Tina"
msgid "I DIDN'T COME HERE TO MAKE FRIENDS!"
msgstr ""

#: tina_triangle/tony_tina_love_join/33
msgctxt "Tony"
msgid "Well yeah, we came here to get a third-"
msgstr ""

#: tina_triangle/tony_tina_love_join/41
msgctxt "Tina"
msgid "SHUT UP! IT'S CALLED THROUPLE TROUBLE, NOT ANNOYING LOSER TROUBLE!"
msgstr ""

#: tina_triangle/tony_tina_love_join/49
msgctxt "Tony"
msgid "Well yeah, I guess... that's technically true."
msgstr ""

#: tina_triangle/tony_tina_love_join/57
msgctxt "Tina"
msgid "I didn't mean it, baby... kiss me!"
msgstr ""

#: tina_triangle/tony_tina_love_join/65
msgctxt "Tony"
msgid "Aww, you... you're just too hot to stay mad at. C'mere."
msgstr ""

#: tina_triangle/tony_tina_love_join/73
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "It isn't the first show of its kind by any stretch, but Tina's dramatics are so raw, so unhinged, so relatively <i>pure</i> in this era of scripted conflicts, that she becomes a mega-star overnight."
msgstr ""

#: tina_triangle/tony_tina_love_join/81
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "She appears with and without Tony on a variety of shows, supplementing her income with club appearances and a series of ill-advised endorsements."
msgstr ""

#: tina_triangle/tony_tina_love_join/89
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Tony does his best to pick up a career in contracting, but it never quite takes off."
msgstr ""

#: tina_triangle/tony_tina_love_join/100
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Left with nothing but his relationship with Tina, Tony reluctantly gives one more shot to the world of reality TV."
msgstr ""

#: tina_triangle/tony_tina_love_join/111
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "You're not sure how happy he is, but his bills are certainly paid."
msgstr ""
